WEBVTT

00:04.450 --> 00:07.450
More free time.

00:07.900 --> 00:11.020
<i>Her name is Chloe Forkroad.</i>

00:11.020 --> 00:14.490
<i>Her parents built up a trade 
group from a small caravan,</i>

00:14.490 --> 00:17.550
<i>and were apparently good enough at
schmoozing to be bestowed noble rank.</i>

00:17.550 --> 00:18.120
<i>But she...</i>

00:19.720 --> 00:24.960
<i>This was my last book... 
How will I pass the time tomorrow?</i>

00:25.680 --> 00:29.420
<i>Should I work up the courage 
to try talking to somebody?</i>

00:32.880 --> 00:35.480
G-G-G-G-Good afternoon.

00:35.480 --> 00:39.850
My name is Ch-Ch-Chloe-e-e-e...

00:41.010 --> 00:42.960
<i>Absolutely not an option.</i>

00:44.620 --> 00:46.920
<i>I wish I could just disappear.</i>

00:49.110 --> 00:51.780
Do you mind if ask you something?

00:53.630 --> 00:56.200
P-Princess Mia?

00:57.440 --> 01:03.760
Yes. And you're Chloe Forkroad of 
the Forkroad Trade Group, correct?

01:03.760 --> 01:05.160
Y-Yes!

01:05.420 --> 01:11.090
I often see you reading. 
Do your reading interests include fiction?

01:11.350 --> 01:14.090
Oh, yes. They do.

01:14.090 --> 01:17.590
But I've finished all the books 
I brought with me, so I...

01:19.340 --> 01:22.140
I've been looking for someone like you!

01:22.450 --> 01:25.140
Would you be friends with me?

01:25.420 --> 01:27.410
What?!

01:27.910 --> 01:31.390
<i>Princess Mia is the most 
influential person in the class.</i>

01:31.390 --> 01:35.490
<i>Would she really want to be 
friends with a nobody like me?</i>

01:36.740 --> 01:38.200
<i>Oh, I see...</i>

01:38.640 --> 01:43.100
<i>She saw that I'm always 
alone and took pity on me.</i>

01:43.760 --> 01:44.660
<i>But...</i>

01:45.060 --> 01:48.020
<i>That bothers me.</i>

01:49.120 --> 01:53.340
Um, why me?

01:53.840 --> 01:56.340
Because you love books!

01:56.340 --> 01:57.300
Huh?

01:57.520 --> 02:00.260
You see, I'm looking for a reading buddy.

02:00.630 --> 02:01.840
A reading buddy?

02:02.270 --> 02:06.220
Actually, I have a story 
I'd like you to read.

02:06.760 --> 02:12.520
<i>I 'd been thinking it was a shame
that only Anne and I read these!</i>

02:13.270 --> 02:15.820
I can read this?

02:15.820 --> 02:17.020
Of course!

02:17.020 --> 02:20.660
I would just love it if you 
could become my reading buddy.

02:24.370 --> 02:26.830
I-I would like that.

02:29.340 --> 02:32.940
<i>A friendship that would never have 
formed in the previous timeline.</i>

02:32.940 --> 02:38.550
<i>Chloe, too, would prove to be of
 great help to Mia in the future,</i>

02:38.550 --> 02:41.280
<i>but she had no way of knowing that yet.</i>

04:12.740 --> 04:17.030
I never realized you liked 
books this much, Princess Mia.

04:14.690 --> 04:20.690
<b>Episode 5: Princess Mia Swoons</b>

04:17.030 --> 04:18.570
Is that so?

04:18.570 --> 04:24.030
If we had a reading club or something, 
we could gather even more book lovers.

04:24.410 --> 04:25.180
Oh?

04:25.770 --> 04:27.240
<i>A club?</i>

04:29.460 --> 04:31.050
Pardon my intrusion.

04:32.240 --> 04:34.370
<i>I have to be able to ride a horse,</i>

04:34.370 --> 04:40.840
<i>so that I can escape quickly 
if a revolution should occur.</i>

04:41.160 --> 04:43.300
<i>The solution to that problem is</i>

04:43.580 --> 04:45.040
<i>the equestrian club!</i>

04:45.040 --> 04:48.760
What's this? What brings you here, miss?

04:48.970 --> 04:51.270
Oh, I remember you...

04:53.900 --> 04:57.230
Oh, right. Sorry about what happened.

04:57.490 --> 05:00.480
I'm a second-year student at the
academy and head of the equestrian club.

05:00.480 --> 05:01.780
Lin Malong.

05:02.280 --> 05:04.320
I'm Mia Luna Tearmoon.

05:05.030 --> 05:10.410
From the sound of your name, are you 
perhaps from the Equestrian Kingdom?

05:10.640 --> 05:14.530
What an honor that the princess 
of Tearmoon knows of us.

05:14.530 --> 05:16.290
So, what can I do for you?

05:17.460 --> 05:23.300
I hope you aren't here to ask me to
 dispose of the horse that sneezed on you.

05:23.710 --> 05:24.870
What do you mean?

05:25.860 --> 05:28.900
I mean, it ruined your dress, didn't it?

05:28.900 --> 05:32.900
That isn't a big deal.

05:32.900 --> 05:37.140
If one has to choose between a dress and a
horse, it's clear which is more valuable.

05:37.660 --> 05:38.940
Oh.

05:39.190 --> 05:40.150
<i>That's right.</i>

05:40.720 --> 05:44.190
<i>A dress won't let you escape 
a revolutionary army,</i>

05:44.190 --> 05:46.970
<i>but a horse will!</i>

05:47.970 --> 05:53.280
Anyway, since this is the equestrian club,
 can I learn how to ride a horse?

05:53.280 --> 05:55.120
Of course.

05:55.120 --> 05:58.080
But why would a princess 
wish to ride a horse?

05:59.120 --> 06:04.920
Because a horse will take me 
however far I wish to go.

06:07.360 --> 06:12.470
<i>That's right! As far away from the 
revolutionary army as possible!</i>

06:12.810 --> 06:14.930
<i>Her words...</i>

06:14.930 --> 06:20.730
<i>These are not the words of one who only 
sees a horse as a tool of war or a pet.</i>

06:21.140 --> 06:25.010
<i>It would seem there's more 
to her than meets the eye.</i>

06:25.690 --> 06:30.650
<i>Mia's words truly struck a
 chord in Malong's heart.</i>

06:30.650 --> 06:32.070
Princess Mia?

06:34.490 --> 06:36.250
Prince Abel!

06:36.530 --> 06:41.210
Have you perhaps joined the 
equestrian club as well?

06:41.570 --> 06:44.840
Yes. I am still a prince 
of the Kingdom of Remno.

06:45.060 --> 06:48.370
I thought I ought to improve 
my riding and swordsmanship.

06:48.370 --> 06:50.300
I see.

06:50.710 --> 06:56.310
<i>In the prior timeline, I'm pretty sure 
Prince Abel was in the game club.</i>

06:56.800 --> 06:59.140
What brings you here, Princess Mia?

06:59.490 --> 07:03.860
I have an interest in riding 
as well, so I decided to visit.

07:04.160 --> 07:06.810
Abel, are the two of you are acquainted?

07:07.240 --> 07:10.680
That's perfect. You can help her ride.

07:11.170 --> 07:14.990
Our visitor is interested in horses. 
We ought to oblige. Right?

07:14.990 --> 07:18.410
Well, um, I... But...

07:18.410 --> 07:22.140
<i>My, my, is Prince Abel feeling bashful?</i>

07:22.910 --> 07:25.270
<i>He's surprisingly innocent.</i>

07:26.400 --> 07:30.970
Prince Abel, I would like 
to request you as my escort.

07:30.970 --> 07:33.590
Well, if that's what you 
want, Princess Mia...

07:34.010 --> 07:41.060
<i>As a mature woman, I'll take the lead 
and demonstrate adult composure!</i>

07:43.060 --> 07:44.990
It's so high up!

07:44.990 --> 07:48.280
<i>Her adult composure did not last long.</i>

07:48.280 --> 07:51.240
Are you ready? Hold on to me—

07:52.490 --> 07:56.160
P-Princess Mia, you don't 
need to hold that tightly!

07:56.160 --> 08:00.120
I know! I've got everything under control!

08:04.230 --> 08:07.080
Princess Mia, open your eyes.

08:07.600 --> 08:10.800
The scenery seen from atop 
a horse is quite something.

08:11.050 --> 08:13.600
Th-That's a good point.

08:17.750 --> 08:18.560
Oh, my!

08:19.180 --> 08:20.760
Not so scary, right?

08:20.760 --> 08:23.810
Indeed. It's quite comfortable.

08:24.690 --> 08:26.380
P-Princess! What are you doing?!

08:27.010 --> 08:30.230
L-Look! The lady who attends you is here!

08:30.230 --> 08:32.570
Why, it is her!

08:32.800 --> 08:34.410
Anne!

08:34.410 --> 08:37.070
Princess! You mustn't let go!

08:41.380 --> 08:42.360
No!

08:42.840 --> 08:43.710
Huh?

08:44.330 --> 08:45.840
It didn't hurt?

08:45.840 --> 08:46.890
Ow, ow, ow.

08:47.340 --> 08:49.290
Are you all right, Princess Mia?

08:49.590 --> 08:52.260
Ah! Huh? Prince Abel?!

08:52.680 --> 08:55.080
<i>Wh-Why am I so flustered?</i>

08:55.080 --> 08:57.720
<i>It's not like I'm trying to 
get Prince Abel to hold me.</i>

08:57.720 --> 09:00.680
<i>That happened plenty at the ball.</i>

09:00.680 --> 09:03.290
<i>What's more, Prince Abel is a child!</i>

09:03.290 --> 09:05.700
<i>He's eight years younger than me!</i>

09:05.700 --> 09:07.650
<i>So, uh... I...</i>

09:07.910 --> 09:11.610
Princess Mia? Are you hurt?

09:14.320 --> 09:16.780
<i>Don't look at me like that.</i>

09:17.020 --> 09:20.760
I-I'm fine! So, um, could 
you not be quite so close?

09:20.760 --> 09:22.490
Oh, yes! Sorry.

09:22.920 --> 09:23.970
My humble apologies.

09:24.490 --> 09:27.820
Um, don't misunderstand me, Prince Abel!

09:28.250 --> 09:32.920
I'm not saying I dislike 
having you close to me.

09:33.350 --> 09:36.230
Right. I understand.

09:37.170 --> 09:41.850
<i>What's this feeling? There's a stinging 
in my chest, and I can't calm down.</i>

09:42.270 --> 09:45.430
<i>Th-This must just be panic</i>

09:45.430 --> 09:48.560
<i>because I won't be able to get 
reinforcements if I make Abel dislike me!</i>

09:48.790 --> 09:51.490
<i>Still, what do I do?</i>

09:51.490 --> 09:53.030
<i>Oh, I know!</i>

09:57.520 --> 10:02.160
Prince Abel, thank you 
for saving me just now.

10:02.560 --> 10:07.120
<i>People naturally create distance when 
others get closer than necessary.</i>

10:07.550 --> 10:11.900
<i>If I make Prince Abel experience that 
reaction, it should clear things up!</i>

10:12.640 --> 10:18.060
Y-You're welcome.
 C-Could you back up a little?

10:18.060 --> 10:21.660
See? You turned away from me, too?

10:21.660 --> 10:23.220
Th-That's because...

10:23.220 --> 10:28.810
The way you're feeling is the 
same way I felt just now.

10:28.810 --> 10:30.300
Th-The same way?

10:30.300 --> 10:35.940
<i>I'm sensitive, so when others get 
unnecessarily close, I get nervous.</i>

10:35.940 --> 10:38.940
<i>Yes, that's it! 
That's all that's going on here.</i>

10:39.480 --> 10:42.530
We feel the same way?

10:42.530 --> 10:44.480
Yes. The exact same.

10:44.480 --> 10:50.670
B-But, I expect that my feelings...
 are much stronger than yours.

10:50.990 --> 10:53.920
My, you're competitive, I see.

10:53.920 --> 10:56.880
<i>Is he trying to say he's 
more sensitive than me?</i>

10:59.630 --> 11:02.530
<i>However, Mia hadn't realized...</i>

11:02.530 --> 11:07.060
<i>that she and Prince Abel were nervous 
for somewhat different reasons...</i>

11:07.420 --> 11:14.250
<i>and that she herself had been nervous 
because a boy she might like got close.</i>

11:20.960 --> 11:24.910
I managed to join the equestrian club, 
and I found a reading buddy.

11:25.300 --> 11:28.810
With the way things are going, 
I bet there's no guillotine!

11:29.630 --> 11:32.750
Oof. That was a losing bet...

11:33.260 --> 11:36.840
Princess Mia, have you heard?

11:37.120 --> 11:41.430
They're going to hold a sword fighting 
tournament at the academy soon.

11:41.670 --> 11:43.430
A sword fighting tournament?

11:43.680 --> 11:47.150
Yes. The maids are all abuzz about it.

11:47.150 --> 11:50.620
And they were also saying that there's 
a custom with the tournament,

11:50.620 --> 11:53.650
where the female students prepare a 
lunch for the gentlemen they like.

11:53.880 --> 11:56.440
Oh? A lunch?

11:56.440 --> 11:59.110
A... lunch?!

12:01.340 --> 12:04.990
Prince Sion, I'll make you a lunch so good

12:04.990 --> 12:07.490
that you'll say it's why 
you won the tournament!

12:12.250 --> 12:14.350
No. I don't need it. Please go.

12:17.120 --> 12:18.550
Why?

12:18.550 --> 12:22.120
When I prepared such a lavish lunch?

12:22.120 --> 12:25.260
<i>The phenomenon known as "eating alone."</i>

12:28.560 --> 12:29.890
P-Princess Mia?!

12:30.230 --> 12:32.960
It's nothing. I'm fine.

12:32.960 --> 12:36.320
<i>I've had enough of that lonely feeling.</i>

12:36.320 --> 12:37.110
<i>I know!</i>

12:37.110 --> 12:40.990
<i>Unlike that stupid Sion, 
Prince Abel is a gentleman.</i>

12:40.990 --> 12:43.360
<i>He'll eat the lunch I prepare!</i>

12:44.380 --> 12:45.620
Prince Abel!

12:46.370 --> 12:47.850
Princess Mia.

12:47.850 --> 12:49.410
Are you practicing today?

12:49.690 --> 12:51.260
Yes, I am.

12:51.260 --> 12:54.870
<i>First, I ought to secure 
agreement ahead of time.</i>

12:55.190 --> 13:00.930
I see. Malong was complimenting how 
seriously you've been taking this.

13:00.930 --> 13:03.090
I feel honored.

13:03.510 --> 13:06.440
Would you like to ride together again?

13:06.440 --> 13:08.810
That would be lovely—

13:09.460 --> 13:14.890
Oh, your palm feels quite a bit rougher.

13:15.150 --> 13:21.110
Yeah. Actually, I've been training a 
lot for the sword fighting tournament.

13:21.380 --> 13:22.890
Prince Abel...

13:23.560 --> 13:25.920
<i>He's been working really hard.</i>

13:31.530 --> 13:36.160
Um, Prince Abel, I have a question
about the day of the tournament.

13:36.160 --> 13:37.000
Oh?

13:37.000 --> 13:42.250
Well, have you made arrangements 
with anyone to prepare your lunch?

13:42.870 --> 13:44.940
No, I can't say that I have.

13:44.940 --> 13:49.440
Then, might I prepare a lunch for you?

13:49.440 --> 13:51.470
Prepare a lunch for me?

13:51.730 --> 13:56.690
Yes. I'll prepare the best 
lunch I can to help you win.

13:57.130 --> 13:58.730
Thank you, Princess Mia.

14:01.830 --> 14:04.760
<i>Good. Now I won't be eating alone.</i>

14:04.760 --> 14:10.310
<i>With that settled, I'll immediately 
go to a shop to place an order myself!</i>

14:10.870 --> 14:15.000
I'm afraid it would be difficult for 
me to take an order for that day.

14:15.270 --> 14:20.670
Every shop gets fully booked with orders 
the week before the tournament.

14:20.980 --> 14:21.530
Wh-

14:21.630 --> 14:22.090
Wh-

14:22.090 --> 14:26.050
What a disaster!

14:26.390 --> 14:27.800
I see.

14:27.800 --> 14:31.360
All the shops were fully booked.

14:31.360 --> 14:34.240
What do I do?

14:34.240 --> 14:35.390
In that case...

14:35.910 --> 14:37.350
Let's make it!

14:37.860 --> 14:38.810
What?

14:39.360 --> 14:43.820
Princess Mia, you can make a 
lunch for Prince Abel yourself!

14:43.820 --> 14:47.500
B-But I've never cooked before...

14:47.500 --> 14:49.290
I'll help you.

14:49.290 --> 14:54.540
Besides, boys love it when 
girls make food for them.

14:54.540 --> 14:56.490
Th-That's a good point.

14:56.740 --> 14:59.910
By the way, Anne. Are you good at cooking?

15:01.440 --> 15:05.210
I-I've baked bread before... I think.

15:05.460 --> 15:06.320
Oh.

15:06.320 --> 15:09.050
<i>This is never going to work.</i>

15:09.870 --> 15:13.800
<i>After sensing danger, 
Mia decided to gather helpers.</i>

15:14.300 --> 15:15.760
Cooking?

15:16.080 --> 15:19.620
Yes. I thought you might 
be well-versed in it.

15:19.620 --> 15:22.550
Yes. I know about cooking.

15:22.550 --> 15:24.400
I read about it in a book before.

15:24.610 --> 15:28.070
<i>"Know about cooking" and 
"read about it in a book"...</i>

15:28.070 --> 15:32.030
<i>R-Remember, Mia, any port in a storm.</i>

15:32.680 --> 15:36.970
The truth is, I would like to make a 
lunch for the sword fighting tournament,

15:36.970 --> 15:39.820
and I thought you might 
be able to do it with me.

15:39.820 --> 15:43.290
It is true that I don't 
have any plans that day...

15:43.580 --> 15:45.280
Then please do join me!

15:45.280 --> 15:47.750
<i>Yes! One down.</i>

15:49.280 --> 15:52.220
Let's see. Anne and Chloe...

15:52.220 --> 15:55.380
Who else might come in handy?

15:56.150 --> 15:59.460
Oh, no! I can't think of anybody else!

15:59.460 --> 16:01.700
I'm at a stalemate already!

16:01.700 --> 16:05.170
Princess Mia, I've found someone 
with cooking skills!

16:05.170 --> 16:09.320
You did? Please take me 
to this person at once!

16:10.400 --> 16:14.160
Princess Mia! I was told you 
wished to speak with me?

16:15.370 --> 16:19.720
A-Anne, is this who you meant?

16:19.720 --> 16:23.210
Yes! I'm sure Lady Tiona 
will be of help to us.

16:23.790 --> 16:28.960
<i>Sh-She's one of the loathsome people 
who sent me to the guillotine!</i>

16:28.960 --> 16:31.920
<i>Oh, why can't I just stay far away from her?</i>

16:32.670 --> 16:37.090
L-Lady Tiona, I heard that 
you're good at cooking.

16:37.090 --> 16:40.890
Yes, we have vast swaths of land 
used extensively for agriculture.

16:41.160 --> 16:44.230
<i>Oh? This sounds promising.</i>

16:44.470 --> 16:46.600
I always cut the vegetables.

16:46.600 --> 16:48.450
I'm a whiz at julienning.

16:48.450 --> 16:49.580
<i>Juli-wha?</i>

16:49.990 --> 16:51.940
Any other skills?

16:52.180 --> 16:56.030
I have dicing down pat, and I can peel, too!

16:56.880 --> 16:58.480
<i>Now it's sounding dicey.</i>

16:58.950 --> 17:03.000
<i>But I can't afford to be picky!</i>

17:03.340 --> 17:06.990
Lady Tiona, on the day of the 
sword fighting tournament,

17:06.990 --> 17:09.780
I plan to make a lunch for Prince Abel.

17:09.780 --> 17:11.890
Would you care to join me?

17:11.890 --> 17:15.390
M-Me? Join you, Princess? I couldn't...

17:15.390 --> 17:19.220
And besides, I have no 
one to give a lunch to.

17:19.620 --> 17:23.890
If that's the issue, how about 
that jerk—ahem, I mean Prince Sion?

17:23.890 --> 17:26.440
You could share what we make with him.

17:26.710 --> 17:28.170
With Prince Sion?

17:28.170 --> 17:30.150
Yes, with Prince Sion.

17:30.740 --> 17:35.600
<i>Should the lunch-making go badly, 
I'll end up serving Abel something off.</i>

17:35.600 --> 17:38.850
<i>That might prevent him from
 performing well in the tournament...</i>

17:38.850 --> 17:43.580
<i>But if we give that to Prince Sion, too,
 then we can take him down with us!</i>

17:45.800 --> 17:48.860
<i>Mia has hatched a ridiculous scheme.</i>

18:01.970 --> 18:04.940
I see you're practicing hard, Your Highness.

18:04.940 --> 18:06.220
Keithwood.

18:09.880 --> 18:12.800
You're as hard to detect as ever.

18:12.800 --> 18:16.530
I imagine this sort of stuff is what's 
stealing all the girls' hearts.

18:17.520 --> 18:18.820
Did you say something?

18:19.090 --> 18:20.190
No, nothing.

18:20.640 --> 18:25.360
By the way, did you pick someone to prepare
your lunch for the sword fighting tournament?

18:25.360 --> 18:29.420
No. I politely declined 
all the offers I've received.

18:29.700 --> 18:31.910
Oh? So then...

18:31.910 --> 18:34.750
I take it you want me to make your lunch?

18:35.030 --> 18:38.660
That's an idea. That wouldn't 
be bad once in a while.

18:38.660 --> 18:40.970
You did used to make me food all the time.

18:41.610 --> 18:46.620
Oh, I did sneak into the kitchen to 
make you late-night snacks, didn't I?

18:46.620 --> 18:50.980
Then we both got yelled at when 
those gave me a cavity, right?

18:54.710 --> 18:58.810
Jokes aside, you've already made 
arrangements for my lunch, right?

18:58.810 --> 19:00.280
Huh? Yes.

19:02.310 --> 19:04.800
<i>As a prince of the Kingdom of Sunkland,</i>

19:04.800 --> 19:08.020
<i>were he to receive a lunch 
from a particular person,</i>

19:08.020 --> 19:11.060
<i>it may have negative political 
consequences later.</i>

19:12.990 --> 19:14.470
You seem to have something to say.

19:14.920 --> 19:16.430
No, no. Nothing in particular.

19:17.340 --> 19:22.700
<i>Your reasoning isn't wrong, but I think 
you could afford to loosen up a little bit.</i>

19:23.960 --> 19:26.640
Well then, I'll leave you to your training.

19:26.640 --> 19:27.310
Bye.

19:30.360 --> 19:32.600
<i>Despite what he said,</i>

19:32.600 --> 19:36.500
<i>His Highness might feel sad about not 
getting to receive a lunch from anyone.</i>

19:37.680 --> 19:42.530
<i>Still, the options that wouldn't 
cause an incident are limited.</i>

19:42.810 --> 19:46.490
<i>Perhaps someone from a major nation 
on par with Sunkland. That leaves...</i>

19:48.520 --> 19:49.410
Figures.

19:50.000 --> 19:51.260
Mr. Keithwood.

19:52.640 --> 19:54.510
What a perfect coincidence.

19:54.510 --> 19:57.600
Oh, Lady Rudolvon.

19:57.600 --> 19:59.330
How may I help you?

19:59.330 --> 20:01.130
Well, you see...

20:02.860 --> 20:05.600
Oh, you're making lunches as a group.

20:05.830 --> 20:11.370
Yes. And I was hoping to inquire whether 
I could give one to Prince Sion.

20:11.370 --> 20:12.800
I see.

20:13.520 --> 20:17.320
<i>A collaborative effort with both 
Princes Abel and Sion as recipients...</i>

20:17.320 --> 20:21.440
<i>That would certainly get around the problem.</i>

20:21.440 --> 20:22.100
Hm...

20:25.690 --> 20:26.870
Mr. Keithwood?

20:27.310 --> 20:32.160
Oh, nothing. I understand. 
I'll inform Prince Sion.

20:32.160 --> 20:33.660
I greatly appreciate it.

20:34.210 --> 20:35.200
Now I must take my leave.

20:36.480 --> 20:41.070
<i>As I would expect of Princess Mia. 
A well-considered plan on multiple levels.</i>

20:41.070 --> 20:44.430
<i>The Wisdom of the Empire 
continues undiminished.</i>

20:46.220 --> 20:50.760
But why do I still have this strange 
unease and a sinking feeling?

20:52.160 --> 20:54.230
Oh, you're making it yourself?

20:54.660 --> 21:00.210
Yes. We'll be making the lunches 
together for you and Prince Sion.

21:00.210 --> 21:02.240
For Prince Sion, too?

21:02.240 --> 21:09.450
We're amateur cooks, so I'm afraid the taste 
may pale in comparison to store-bought.

21:09.840 --> 21:15.670
<i>Phew. Now I have my defensive measures 
in place in case it tastes awful.</i>

21:15.960 --> 21:18.740
Actually, the idea of you making it
 yourself makes makes me happy.

21:19.510 --> 21:21.380
You're happy about it?

21:21.380 --> 21:25.330
When I was younger, my mom and 
older sister cooked for me.

21:25.330 --> 21:27.190
It always made me happy.

21:27.190 --> 21:30.120
So thank you. I'm looking forward to it.

21:30.570 --> 21:33.600
<i>What? Did I just make 
things harder for myself?</i>

21:33.910 --> 21:35.490
Well, here we are.

21:42.110 --> 21:46.260
I didn't know there was 
such a lovely spot here!

21:47.690 --> 21:49.660
I'm glad you like it.

21:49.660 --> 21:51.280
Remember to watch your step.

21:54.660 --> 21:56.970
Oh, thank you.

22:01.920 --> 22:06.370
<i>Oh, how wonderful to walk along such 
a pretty lake shore with a gentleman.</i>

22:06.370 --> 22:09.390
<i>This was unthinkable to me 
when I was in the dungeon.</i>

22:09.770 --> 22:12.890
Still, I must admit that 
I'm slightly disappointed.

22:12.890 --> 22:14.100
You are? Why?

22:14.530 --> 22:20.060
I'm disappointed I won't get to be 
the only one who eats your food.

22:21.320 --> 22:24.400
<i>I-I-I can't believe he just said that!</i>

22:24.400 --> 22:26.640
<i>Could it be that he's a simpleton?!</i>

22:27.350 --> 22:31.490
Are you all right? If you're tired,
 please rest for a while.

22:34.250 --> 22:37.410
I'll just do some sword 
practice while you rest.

22:37.670 --> 22:40.010
Th-Thank you.

22:47.380 --> 22:50.510
You are training quite fervently.

22:50.810 --> 22:55.820
It's true. I've never swung 
my sword this hard before.

22:56.440 --> 22:59.940
But I have an opponent 
I desperately want to beat.

23:00.250 --> 23:01.900
An opponent to beat?

23:02.260 --> 23:06.980
Yes. Which is why I also feel 
better about the lunch thing now.

23:07.280 --> 23:09.950
Oh? What do you mean?

23:10.290 --> 23:14.260
If I were to be the only 
one who eats your food,

23:14.260 --> 23:18.660
people might say that's why 
I was able to defeat Prince Sion.

23:19.640 --> 23:22.160
So you mean...

23:23.070 --> 23:26.610
<i>Mia realized that the level 
of expectation surrounding</i>

23:26.610 --> 23:29.520
<i>her handmade lunch was through the roof.</i>

23:34.970 --> 23:39.930
Illustration by Fujiazuki
